  │    "title": "The Sealed Pamphlet",
  │    "desc": "Thomas Cobb must smuggle a Wycliffe vernacular pamphlet past a bishop's checkpoint. DC 13 Deception. faith_reform track.",
  │    "hint": "The pamphlet is inside your coat. The bishop's man is looking at your face, not your coat.",
